  "label": "Freedom of Speech",
  "description": "A fundamental right in many democratic societies, including the United States, protected by the First Amendment. It allows individuals to express opinions without government censorship or restraint. The meme uses this concept ironically by juxtaposing it with a man who appears disengaged or unenthusiastic, implying that his expression of 'freedom of speech' is hollow or performative.",
